<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head><body><p>#if(!$user.lastName or $user.lastName=='')Dear $user.firstName, #else Dear $user.firstName $user.lastName,#end</p><br />
<p>Please be informed that $admin.firstName $admin.lastName has created a user account for you.</p>
<p>In order to activate and login to your account please <a href="$HOST/mp/openid?hd=$googleappsdomain">click here</a><br />
(or copy/paste and go to following link in your  web browser: $HOST/mp/openid?hd=$googleappsdomain</p>


<p>Thank you for your interest in our product.</p>

</body></html>